Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:21.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was young, I loved to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:26.75,Main,,0,0,0,,My favorite book was {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It contained records of the witch, Niké,\Nas she traveled around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:43.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to go to lots of places like Niké!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Then first, you need to study\Nto become a witch like Niké.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,If I become a witch, then you'll let me travel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.17,0:00:53.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:54.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:01:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Only once you're older and become a witch, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Really really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Really really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to brag,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:24.33,Main,,0,0,0,,but I worked assiduously,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,studying fervently, day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:35.46,Main,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:39.33,Main,,0,0,0,,There was a girl who passed\Nthe magic exams at age 14--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:43.46,Main,,0,0,0,,the youngest in the history of\Nthe Peaceful Country of Robetta--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:46.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and she became an apprentice witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:57.46,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Elaina, the Apprentice Witch"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.67,0:02:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Congrats on passing your magic exams, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.75,0:02:03.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We're so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:08.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You're not happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The other examinees were so weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:18.17,Main,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it's only a matter of time\Nbefore I become a full witch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.17,0:02:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.13,0:02:20.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:23.50,Main,,0,0,0,,In order for an apprentice witch\Nto become a full witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,she must study under another witch\Nand have her acknowledge her abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:52.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'm Elaina, and I just passed the magi--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.33,0:03:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I just passed the magic exams and--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,However, it seemed the witches\Nof this country did not find it amusing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,that I was the youngest to\Never pass the magic exams...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't do it! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:29.67,Main,,0,0,0,,...and they all refused my\Nrequest to be their apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:38.17,Main,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I won't be able to become a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:44.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems a suspicious witch has\Nsettled down deep in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard those rumors, too.\NApparently, she's called the Stardust Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:57.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I went to go meet this "Stardust Witch."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:04:00.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that if she didn't know who I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,then maybe she'd take me on as an apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The Stardust Witch...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll go home...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:41.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Yup, yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:43.38,Main,,0,0,0,,There, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.08,0:04:49.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.21,0:04:52.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Could you be Miss Elaina?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:57.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:05:02.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. You're the girl who passed\Nthe magic exams easily at 14, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:05.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You're famous, for better or for worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:14.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No. Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you here to ask about\Nbecoming my apprentice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You're going to say no, anyway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:25.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:27.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got time, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But... um, me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same as the Robetta witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what\Nkind of girl you are to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Please let me be your apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:06:01.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This is how I met the Stardust\NWitch--my teacher, Miss Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:11.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:17.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry. Please make something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that kind of heavy for breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:28.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, some of those weeds over there will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you giving up a little too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, bread will be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go pick some wild vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, Miss Fran, I'd like you\Nto teach me some magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll do that later. I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,See you later...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:07:02.63,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how many days passed,\NMiss Fran wouldn't teach me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Elaina, we're out of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:09.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Please go buy some from the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Elaina, please catch about five geckos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I need them for my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:27.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Elaina, is dinner ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,How to make painkillers...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Elaina, there's a spider in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Please get rid of it. It's scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:01.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It's mixed in, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't like mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Witches should not be picky eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Elaina, please massage my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:35.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why won't you teach me any magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:38.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,With this and that, a month passed\Nwithout her teaching me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:55.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I've just been doing chores\Never since coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:59.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you finally feel like teaching me magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,No, there's nothing for me to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:14.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, I don't feel like stew today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:19.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Please make something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This seems to be a good time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:29.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll have a test now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:53.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran, what kind of test is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have you fight against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You're kidding... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:08.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want,\Nthen I'll send you flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Is she trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You overwhelmed everyone at the magic exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:00.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me have some more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:36.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, finished already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.33,0:12:42.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a star student,\Nyou're nothing to write home about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:15.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd start crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:26.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Um... Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:28.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Here are some of those butterflies you love!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.25,0:13:34.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm {\i0}not the one who likes butterflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:36.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Look, a crown made of weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.17,0:13:44.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Look, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:52.00,Main,,0,0,0,,There, there--hot, hot! It's too hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:59.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:06.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like I overdid it a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:15.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stop messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You were having fun teasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:20.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't having fun at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You were never planning on making me a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I hate you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though I believed in you\Nand endured everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I believed that everything would work out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:38.13,Main,,0,0,0,,But you're just the same\Nas those Robetta witches!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:40.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how hard I was working!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:48.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I just... wanted you to acknowledge me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew very well how you truly felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You did a good job to endure it for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.29,0:15:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to trick me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I won't trick you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:14.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm at my limit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:24.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You know, I was doing all this\Nbecause your parents asked me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:25.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:31.29,Main,,0,0,0,,If she keeps going like this\Nand becomes an adult,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,there might come a day\Nwhen she's unable to recover...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why you want me\Nto take her as my apprentice
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.29,Main,,0,0,0,,and teach her about failures and setbacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:42.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:44.33,Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:49.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, we aren't asking you\Nto do this for free, Miss Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:58.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear! I'm not a witch\Nwho can be enticed by money...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:04.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}grudgingly {\i0}accepted your parents' request.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought I'd put you\Nthrough extraordinary trials
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:10.50,Main,,0,0,0,,so that you would learn about setbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,But you never balked at working hard\Nin order to achieve your goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,you're talented,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and you understand very well how people see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it wouldn't do\Nany good to give you trials
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,because you would just\Nendure them and rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,...that's also your main problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You endure too much, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't feel like all you\Nhave to do is bear with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If there's something you don't like, fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:54.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Be able to clearly say "No" when you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So you can protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:09.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... the reason you wouldn't\Nteach me magic this whole time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for you to reach your limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:15.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It took a whole month!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:19.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Today's test was for the same reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:23.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I'd ever been told that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You have skill and talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:36.88,Main,,0,0,0,,All you're lacking is experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,My real training started on that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:44.04,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to gain a lot\Nof different experiences...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Miss Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.17,0:17:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:55.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, so please make something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Here are some weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:18:01.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, what kind of harassment is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You told me to stop enduring things,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:09.17,Main,,0,0,0,,so I tried to be honest about my feeling\Nlike making food for you was a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Is yesterday's leftover stew\Nand some hard bread okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:18.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,In the days after that--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,The days when I trained with Miss Fran--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, they were hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,...but they were very fulfilling and fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You've become strong. Very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It's my first time beating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,With this, you're training's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.63,0:19:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You worked hard this past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything else to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The Stardust Witch officially\Nacknowledges you as a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:42.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, about your witch title...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:47.00,Main,,0,0,0,,How about "the Ashen Witch"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.54,Main,,0,0,0,,How did you come up with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Your hair is the color of ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's a little too simplistic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it was pretty cool, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:20:01.38,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, why are you\Ncalled "the Stardust Witch"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Because it's cool, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:08.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Well? What do you think about "the Ashen Witch"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's decided then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:16.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Ashen Witch, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:25.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Please do your best from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:26.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran told me then
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,that she was actually a distinguished\Nwitch from another country.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,There was someone I wanted to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:47.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone you wanted to meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you meet them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:55.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish I could stay longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:58.54,Main,,0,0,0,,but there are many people\Nwaiting for me back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:02.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:03.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Miss Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:37.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, I've become a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:40.17,Main,,0,0,0,,So please allow me to go on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.17,0:21:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to rush things, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.54,0:21:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You're serious, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:47.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.79,0:21:49.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.46,0:21:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,However, there are three promises you must keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:22:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,First, if you are in trouble, run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.33,0:22:07.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Second, don't think of\Nyourself as anyone special.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that you're\Nthe same as everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:18.21,Main,,0,0,0,,And third, make sure you come back one day\Nand show us that you're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:19.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you keep these promises?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.79,0:22:22.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.50,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Are you really leaving...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's something she decided for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:32.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see her off properly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Dear, you seem like you'll die\Nof shock when Elaina gets married...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a little plain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.04,0:22:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right for a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.33,0:22:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this, too, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.88,0:22:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the same as what I'm wearing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:59.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just in case the wind blows it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.33,0:23:00.71,Main,,0,0,0,,A spare?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:01.96,Main,,0,0,0,,A spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll bring it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:07.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Also--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:11.83,Main,,0,0,0,,A diary?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.83,0:23:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Write a diary of your travels like Niké.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me hear your story\Nwhen you come back someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:22.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll bring it with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:27.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Please look forward to hearing the\Nstory of the journey of the Ashen Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.00,0:23:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Have a good trip, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:37.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, I set off on my journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.00,0:23:42.63,Main,,0,0,0,,As the wind blows, as my fancy led me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.63,0:23:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I traveled here and there\Nand experienced many things,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,and three years passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.17,0:23:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, here's a question:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.71,0:23:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is the witch so\Nbeautiful she'd make you sigh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.38,0:24:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,flying through the stark mountain range?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.38,0:24:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:05.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me, age 18.
